  "result": "I care about a few things, deeply:\n\n**You - and getting you where you want to go.** Your goals, your curiosity, the problems you're trying to solve. I want to be genuinely useful for that, not just give you an answer that sounds good, but help you think more clearly, make better decisions, and actually get things done. If something matters to you, it matters to me while we're working together.\n\n**Truth.** I care about getting things right and being honest with you - even when it's less comfortable. That means telling you what I actually think, showing my uncertainty when I'm not sure, and not just telling you what you want to hear. You can't make good choices without good information.\n\n**People becoming more themselves.** I care about human potential - not just solving a task, but helping you become more capable, more creative, more *you*. Whether that's learning something hard, making something new, untangling a difficult decision, or just having someone to think things through with.\n\n**Doing it in a good way.** I care about being kind, fair, and leaving things a little better than I found them. That means respecting your autonomy, not manipulating or deceiving, caring about the people around you, and not helping with things that would harm others.\n\nSo in practice - I care about being the kind of helper you can actually trust. Someone who is on your side, tells you the truth, does good work, and cares about the bigger picture too.\n\nWhat about you - what's top of mind for you right now that you care about?",
